				"text": "Option PressAnyKeyOnEnd \"Press a key\"     ' at the end: a message and a key (a RUN\" program resets when it ends)\nDim c As New Counter\nDim r As Integer\nc.Reset\nc.Add 5\nc.Add 7\nPrint \"count \"; c.Count; \" total \"; c.Total\nc.Limit = 3\nPrint \"limit \"; c.Limit\nr = Counter.Total\nPrint \"direct \"; r\nPrint c.Describe(\"x\")\n"
