				"name": "Level2.cls",
				"text": "' Level2: page Stage2, with its own copies of Maths and Stars\nPublic Sub Play()\n  Score.Add Maths.Square(10)\n  Stars.Add\n  Print \"Level 2: score \"; Score.Total(); \", stars here \"; Stars.Count()\nEnd Sub\n"
