				"name": "Main.bas",
				"text": "' the console statements go through the project's own StdIO class\nOption PressAnyKeyOnEnd \"Press a key\"     ' at the end: a message and a key (a RUN\" program resets when it ends)\nDim n As Integer, s As String\nn = 42\nPrint \"hello\"; n, \"x\"\nCls\nLocate 3, 4\nInput \"name\"; s\nPrint s\nk$ = Inkey$\nPrint k$; Inkey\nInput \"num\"; n\nPrint n + 1\nPrint \"lines \"; StdIO.Lines\n"
